WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Guts!! gatsu gatsu!! Guts gatsu!! / 
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Guts!! gatsu gatsu!! Guts gatsu!! / 
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
umai mon tachi yonderuze / 
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
kueba kuu hodo afureru Power!! / 
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
sekaijuu kara tsukamaero / 
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
yume ha muteki no gurume sa Fighter!! / 
I dream of being an invincible Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
saa! umi no soko e hyouga no hate e / 
Now on to the bottom of the sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
tonde Jump! Jump! Jump! tatake Knock! Knock! Knock! / 
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
kansha komete / 
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
itadakimasu!! / 
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! kugi punch Wow wo!! renpatsu de!! / 
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
gattsu gattsuri gattsu!! donna yume mo kueru /
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! ore dake no Wow wo!! full course / 
Wow wo!! My very own... Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
gattsu gattsuri gattsu!! Atsumerunosa / 
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
sekai wo sara ni nosete / 
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow yama wo kue!! / 
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow Toriko!! / 
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow umi wo kue!! / 
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow tori tori tori Toriko!! / 
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:49.280
Someone once said:

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:54.460
There is a thicket on which spreads 
out grass that's hard like a rock,

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:57.430
but feels smooth as silk to the touch,

00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:05.200
and when shaved and eaten 
tastes like katsuo and kelp...

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:09.270
The Katsuo Bush!

00:02:10.170 --> 00:02:12.910
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:18.150
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:24.520
In order to regenerate his left 
arm, Toriko struggled hard in Life.

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:29.720
Elsewhere, while trying to 
recreate the Century Soup,

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:32.990
Komatsu managed to get within 
one final step of completing it.

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:34.890
And just then...

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:42.100
To the World of Ultimate Bliss! 
Taste the Century Soup!

00:02:52.550 --> 00:02:53.450
Toriko?

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:02.720
W-What?

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:55.740
T-The soup... is complete...

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:56.870
Toriko?

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:57.370
Hey.

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:16.590
I'm healed!

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:21.330
Toriko! Thank goodness!

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:22.030
Rin!

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:26.700
Now, hug me with that 
newly-grown arm of yours!

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:25.300
But he was just at death's door a moment ago.

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:28.770
And just when I thought you were a goner...

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:31.140
Your cells went and 
activated all of a sudden!

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:39.350
Great work busting that "it'll take 
20 years to heal" rule to smithereens!

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:45.750
H-Hey, where are you going?

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:47.120
It's calling me...

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:57.030
Delicious food is calling me!

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:05.340
Who would have thought that your 
drool would be the final ingredient?

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:07.380
I would have never even dreamed...

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:12.510
Feeding on each generation's Century Soup,

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:15.580
the taste of the soup must be 
embedded throughout your body.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:18.920
That drool is some high-grade stuff, 
like the nest of a storm petrel.

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:28.000
Thank you for choosing me.

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:47.510
Looks like he completed the soup.

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:55.220
A huge mass of press is descending 
on the Hotel Gourmet!

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:57.690
Congratulations on completing 
the legendary soup!

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:01.630
When will the legendary 
soup be placed on the menu?

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:04.060
When will you publish the recipe?

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:08.300
Let me through.

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:11.040
I have come for a tasting.

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:13.940
Mr. Patch!

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:18.910
One of the tasting masters selected 
from the major nations of the IGO!

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:22.080
A member of the Gourmet Seven, 
Mr. Patch has appeared!

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:25.120
Oh my, if it isn't Patch-sama!

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:28.090
Chef, prepare the soup.

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:30.320
Um, manager...

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:34.160
If we can get the approval of the 
G7, our hotel will gain stars!

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:36.090
Komatsu-kun!

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:38.230
I apologize.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:41.900
But I cannot serve you 
the soup at this moment.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.770
Why is that?

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:47.470
Because there are some people 
I'd like to try it first.

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:51.180
Oh? Customers that come before me?

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.080
Komatsu!

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:56.550
Toriko-san, Coco-san!

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:00.320
Toriko? And Coco, as well?

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:03.090
The living Gourmet National Treasure, 
Setsuno-san, is here as well!

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:05.990
I've come to drink some of your Century Soup!

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:10.590
Your arm... It's healed...

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.900
Thank goodness!

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:18.100
Toriko-san, please tell us how 
you feel before tasting the soup!

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:26.110
Quite a racket...

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:27.040
Hey!

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:35.520
Sorry to make you wait, Komatsu.

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:41.520
It took me a long time as well, 
but I finally completed it!

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.590
The Century Soup!

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:45.960
Yeah. I noticed.

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:50.930
Toriko's Gourmet Cells reacted 
to the completion of the soup,

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:53.200
causing an extremely powerful super recovery.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:55.870
What a fearsome life energy...

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.270
Or rather, a fearsome appetite.

00:07:58.270 --> 00:07:59.340
You did it.

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:05.050
Takimaru-san, how is Aimaru-san doing?

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:08.250
Yes... He won't take the 
medicine, no matter what.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:10.150
I see...

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:13.190
Don't worry, I'll definitely 
get him to take it.

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:18.260
You really completed it?

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.360
I won't believe it 'til I've drunk it myself.

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:21.800
Match-san!

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:24.570
Please take some to the 
children in the city, as well.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:27.340
I have to thank you, Komatsu-kun.

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:29.770
You managed to revive an 
ingredient with your cooking

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:31.670
that I couldn't revive myself.

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:35.310
No... I was only able to 
recreate the Century Soup

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:38.310
because you allowed me 
to taste the final drop.

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:40.350
It was you, Teppei-san...

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:42.520
All of you, who enabled 
me to complete the soup.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:45.350
And the ingredients, as well!

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:46.690
Yes!

00:08:46.890 --> 00:08:51.120
I finally understand what you 
were telling me, Setsuno-san!

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:52.930
I see, I see.

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:56.200
The ingredients must have 
spoken to you quite a bit!

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:59.870
Good for you, being chosen 
by the ingredients!

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:00.530
Right!

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:02.940
Let's hurry up and taste the soup already!

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:05.770
I agree, one heaping helping's worth!

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:07.640
Tina-san!

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.880
Because I'm going to get a huge scoop!

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:12.150
Gourmet TV!

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:13.410
An exclusive interview?!

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:15.580
Oh, where's Sunny-san?

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:17.950
He had something to do, so he stayed in Life.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:19.550
Why don't we bring some to him later?

00:09:19.550 --> 00:09:20.520
Yes...

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:23.390
I don't see Zombie-san or the others...

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:26.560
They were arrested after trying 
to capture a Doctor Fish.

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:28.930
Those people never change...

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:33.430
Patch-sama, I do apologize!

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:34.800
No, it's fine.

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:37.170
If they were first on the 
waiting list, so be it.

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:38.400
I will come again.

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:40.070
R-Right...

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:42.740
But I have a word of warning.

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.940
That chef's name will be 
known around the world

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:47.810
now that he's completed the soup.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:51.320
I recommend assigning him 
a bodyguard from now on.

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:56.490
We are fully booked today 
- Restaurant Gourmet

00:09:56.490 --> 00:10:01.430
Now then, everyone... Please 
enjoy this Century Soup!

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:08.000
We give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty...

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:11.000
Let's eat!

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:21.210
A-Amazing!

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:22.750
The aurora's appeared!

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:24.850
This is the real...

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:32.320
...Century Soup!

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:53.180
It's so clear, it's like 
there's nothing there...

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:56.550
But the soup is definitely there.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:00.250
This warmth... How incredibly gentle!

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:02.850
How many dozens of hours has it been boiled,

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:05.420
to have this warmth preserved 
at just the right temperature?

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:09.630
And the smell... So good 
I can't even describe it.

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:14.030
A rich aroma of hundreds of ingredients 
is playing a perfect harmony...

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:18.270
This soup has a high-class sound.

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:21.400
It's a melody that's refreshing and pleasant,

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:24.170
but I can feel the weight of ancient times.

00:11:26.110 --> 00:11:28.810
The ears, of enjoyment...

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:30.550
The eyes, in anticipation...

00:11:30.550 --> 00:11:32.580
The hands, holding satisfaction...

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.480
The nose, filled to brimming...

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:38.320
To think one could experience 
it in ways other than taste!

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:42.260
What an incredible soup!

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:46.690
Huh? What?

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:48.700
I chewed it!

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:53.830
The taste was so rich, I thought for 
a moment it was hamburger steak!

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:02.110
The strata of deliciousness 
layered up from ancient times...

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:05.480
I can feel them releasing one 
after another inside my mouth!

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:11.350
All the sleeping primordial tastes 
are awakening one after another!

00:12:14.450 --> 00:12:17.190
An ancient flavor, and yet fresh!

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:19.360
So incredibly satisfying!

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:21.630
This is the Century Soup?

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:23.160
Yum...

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:24.160
What?

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.300
All my power is...

00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:29.740
The corners of my eyes are drooping, 
and the corners of my mouth are rising!

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:34.170
My face can't help but make a smile!

00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:37.780
It's so delicious, and so satisfying!

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:40.610
I'm grinning!

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:56.600
Everyone's making that silly face!

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:00.330
What's with you?

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:03.440
Same with you, Match-san!

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:08.570
Hey, you made a kind of funny face!

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:09.770
I'm embarrased.

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:12.810
I'll report how it tastes myself!

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:15.150
Delish...

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:18.350
Komatsu!

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:25.190
May I have this in my Full Course?

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:29.230
T-The soup I... I created?

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:33.030
What are you crying for?

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:35.430
I'm the one that asked you!

00:13:35.430 --> 00:13:36.700
I-I'm honored!

00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:40.170
You cry too much... Come on, drink some soup.

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:44.840
Komatsu is grinning while he's crying.

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:47.680
Yay, yay...

00:13:55.120 --> 00:14:00.890
Wall Penguin... So it was you that 
was the key to completing the soup?

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:02.730
How could you tell?

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:06.300
When you've been cooking as long as I have,

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:08.730
you can tell when an 
ingredient walks up to you.

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:12.700
A certain something from this 
guy was the final ingredient.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:13.870
Was it?

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:17.010
So, are you going to apply 
for a patent on the soup?

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:21.310
Since it's a special dish, they 
should grant you a patent for it.

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:25.350
No, I won't.

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:28.620
To get a patent, I'd have 
to publish the recipe.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:33.820
The Wall Penguins are endangered, 
so I can't have them being hunted.

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:35.360
And besides...

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:38.290
It's part of Toriko-san's Full Course!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.830
I'll protect it with all I've got!

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:44.830
That's very much like you, Komatsu-kun.

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:46.630
Okay!

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:49.370
I'll get the ingredients you 
need whenever you'd like!

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:50.910
Leave it to me, Komatsu!

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:52.270
Right, Toriko-san!

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:54.280
What a strange feeling.

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:55.110
Yes...

00:14:55.110 --> 00:14:57.180
Being right here for the moment

00:14:57.180 --> 00:15:00.150
that Toriko decided on a 
part of his Full Course...

00:15:00.150 --> 00:15:04.690
With the hors d'oeuvre BB Corn making 
your stomach cry in anticipation,

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:06.950
it'll be answered right off the bat...

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.990
...with the Century Soup!

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:10.520
Century Soup

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:12.890
Thank you, Komatsu.

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:14.230
Toriko-san...

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:16.500
Now, let's toast with this soup!

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:19.200
Cheers!

00:15:20.400 --> 00:15:25.240
The G7 has officially recognized 
Chef Komatsu's soup.

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:28.070
There's a rush of people 
every day at Hotel Gourmet!

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:31.750
It's been bumped up in rank from a 
five-star hotel to a six-star hotel!

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:34.480
My special exclusive Century Soup report

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:37.180
will be broadcast as a special tomorrow,

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:38.180
so everyone, please tune in!

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:39.990
Now, on to the next story...

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:40.290
Oh, you're back!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:42.290
It's Match and the gang!

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.510
What is this?

00:16:00.510 --> 00:16:02.440
There's nothing showing up!

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:03.810
Is this pantomime?

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:05.740
The "air soup" championships?

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:10.150
No, no... The Century Soup 
is just very transparent!

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:12.720
We can't broadcast this!

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:19.260
Please, take the medicine, Aimaru-san!

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:22.490
My life ends here.

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:25.100
Naturally...

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:26.660
That's what I trust my life to.

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:30.540
This medicine is 100% natural!

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:33.700
It does not violate any of the 
Gourmet Knight's teachings!

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:34.740
No...

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.080
Taki, enough.

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:43.150
Aimaru-san!

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:45.350
I have a message from Toriko-san.

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:48.790
You met Toriko?

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.090
I see!

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:58.330
Then, there is a point to 
me living a little longer.

00:16:58.330 --> 00:16:59.200
And this...

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:04.230
Part of Toriko-san's Full 
Course, Century Soup.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.200
Toriko...

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:15.910
Toriko-san, what in the world 
did you tell Aimaru-san?

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:18.950
The info that GOD, the Main 
of Acacia's Full Course,

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:20.950
will appear within a few years.

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:24.590
Wait, GOD really exists?!

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:26.760
There's just a rumor!

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:28.890
Oh, just a rumor.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:31.830
Toriko, do you know about GOD?

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:33.330
Of course!

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:35.700
It's the origin of all the 
ingredients in the world.

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:38.930
I've decided to make GOD my main dish.

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:41.400
How about it?

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:44.570
Should we have a contest to see 
which one of us finds GOD first?

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:48.180
No... I have my teachings 
as a Gourmet Knight.

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:50.710
What, don't like to lose?

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:51.380
What?

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:54.920
Fine, then! I'll take you on!

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:58.850
Oh yeah? But I'll have you know, I'm strong!

00:18:06.590 --> 00:18:11.370
Boss, I have brought you the 
Century Soup from Ice Hell.

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:15.870
Boss?

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:32.720
To think that such an ingredient 
still existed in the Human World.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:38.390
But the ingredients I am after are, 
in the end, of the Gourmet World.

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:41.660
Alfaro...

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:47.600
How many in the headquarters 
can enter the Gourmet World?

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:48.400
Yes.

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:51.500
There's the Head Chef, Kuromado.

00:18:52.510 --> 00:18:58.850
The Vice Chefs, Starjun, 
Grinpatch, and Tommyrod.

00:18:58.850 --> 00:19:05.720
Plus, the head of Branch #1, Elg, and 
the sommelier, Limon, are almost ready.

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:10.090
You should have the others drink this soup.

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:14.660
That way, you can increase the number 
who can enter the Gourmet World.

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:16.260
Understand?

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:19.770
We are after ingredients 
in the Gourmet World now.

00:19:20.370 --> 00:19:23.900
Those who can't enter should use GT Robots.

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:28.710
Our final goal is, ultimately, GOD.

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:29.940
Do not forget that.

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:37.050
He just drank a single taste, but I can 
tell the level of his cells increased.

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:40.080
However, the Boss didn't react very much.

00:19:41.090 --> 00:19:46.090
Is GOD truly the only ingredient 
that can satisfy the Boss?

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:48.530
Or is it...

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:57.570
You actually hurt me! As expected from 
Sunny, one of the Four Heavenly Kings!

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:01.810
But you can't enter the 
Gourmet World just with that!

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:05.140
Earth is in the Gourmet World, right?

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:05.940
It is!

00:20:05.940 --> 00:20:11.210
You'll tell me where it is if I get the 
power to enter the Gourmet World, right?

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:13.380
I promise.

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:17.120
I'm a man who breaks rules, 
but I keep promises.

00:20:17.120 --> 00:20:21.190
Hey, Sunny, Yosaku!

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:24.590
We brought you the completed Century Soup!

00:20:24.590 --> 00:20:26.630
We drank a little bit, though...

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:27.300
Whoa!

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:29.430
What's with those disgusting 
faces you're making?!

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:33.440
What? And why are you all beat up, Sunny?

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:35.140
Get in a fight?

00:20:35.140 --> 00:20:37.410
That's not very elegant of you, Sunny-san.

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:39.410
You're the ones without any elegance!

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:41.240
Gross! Get away from me!

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:44.750
Come on, just taste it, Sunny-san.

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:47.780
Century Soup...

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:49.750
Let me drink it, too!

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:53.090
The Century Soup!

00:20:53.090 --> 00:20:55.660
This is delicious!

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:57.990
Yosaku-san, you're making a funny face!

00:20:57.990 --> 00:21:00.060
Drink some, Sunny!

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:01.860
No way.

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:04.200
I do not want to make such a hideous face.

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:07.700
But it's so delicious...

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:11.810
The Aurora is beautiful. 
That much I will admit.

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:14.280
But everything else is gross!

00:21:14.510 --> 00:21:16.080
saburina / 
Sabrina

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:19.310
