00:22:15.740 --> 00:22:17.470
Gourmet News!

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:20.070
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:25.950
Chefs once struggled to 
create the Century Soup.

00:22:25.950 --> 00:22:30.020
Topping tofu with mini "sen" 
cherries gets you Sen Cherry Tofu!

00:22:30.350 --> 00:22:35.090
Add (iri) syrup to green tea 
(sencha) to get Sencha Iri Syrup!

00:22:35.350 --> 00:22:40.890
And, from adding sweet things 
to tea they made this discovery!

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:45.130
Mix sugar and milk into barley tea...

00:22:45.130 --> 00:22:47.470
...and it will taste like milk coffee!

00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:49.900
Now, let's go ahead and drink up!

00:22:49.900 --> 00:22:51.770
This milk coffee should be dairy good!

00:22:52.070 --> 00:22:53.640
Maybe even moo-ving?

00:22:53.640 --> 00:22:54.840
Am I milking this too much?

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:01.880
It's cold, so drink it hot!

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:04.980
Now then, on to the next story.

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:08.390
A huge helping of gorgeous design!

00:23:08.390 --> 00:23:10.010
And it tastes good!?

00:23:10.010 --> 00:23:12.860
Let's all drop by Toriko's house!

00:23:13.170 --> 00:23:16.360
Housewarming Party! Everyone Gather at the Sweets House!

00:23:16.690 --> 00:23:18.470
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
